  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/01/P1310050.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(65 fotos) El grupo ondense de flamenquito Los Makis ha protagonizado un multitudinario concierto la noche de este martes, Rosc&oacute;n de Reyes, en Cervecer&iacute;a La Siesta, de la calle Cervantes, 59, en Onda. El numeroso p&uacute;blico asistente ha coreado sus canciones, han bailado sin parar y se lo han pasado en grande.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310037.jpg\" alt=\"p1310037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310038.jpg\" alt=\"p1310038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310040.jpg\" alt=\"p1310040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310041.jpg\" alt=\"p1310041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310042.jpg\" alt=\"p1310042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310044.jpg\" alt=\"p1310044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310045.jpg\" alt=\"p1310045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310046.jpg\" alt=\"p1310046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/losmakislasiesta050116/p1310047.jpg\" alt=\"p1310047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:aut